      "path": "files/timing.png",
      "caption": "One-day direction contrasts and descriptive lag curves. Positive contrast means greater north-to-south lead correlation. Full-period bars are 98.33% percentile intervals; period bars are 95% intervals. Curves have lag-specific date samples and no peak test."
    }
